    "energy_verbatim": "中（三拍换位构成节拍，无爆点；光标是收尾的注意力交接）",
    "energy_rationale": "三拍换位构成节拍，无爆点；光标是收尾的注意力交接"
  },
  "intent_zh": "四个功能挨个全屏展示会切四刀，观众每次都要重新定位。走廊式 carousel 只有一个视觉 中心：居中的那块是主角，左右各露一截邻居的边缘告诉观众\"还有更多、这是同一条队列\"。 末段的光标是刻意的：它把叙事从\"系统在自动播放\"交回\"这是一个人在操作\"，为下一拍的 交互镜头做交接。",
  "use_zh": "多功能横向枚举（Feature A–D 各一屏）；产品概览、功能巡览类段落，也可作落地页 hero 的循环底",
  "summary_zh": "四块浅灰 dashboard wireframe 面板各顶一枚高光胶囊标签横向排队，轨道三拍向右换位（缓起→中段冲→缓收，首拍更慢带长尾），居中者放大清晰、两侧缩到 0.62 并下沉变淡微模糊形成走廊感，末段黑色描白边光标从右上斜滑到末位胶囊右端静止",
  "beats": [
    {
      "ord": 0,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "这是**手法模板**：面板内容全是通用 wireframe 占位（顶栏 + 左侧导航 + 三栏卡片 /"
    },
    {
      "ord": 1,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "折线图仪表盘 / 列表表格 / 表单开关列表四种页型），只用灰条与色块拼出，落地时整块"
    },
    {
      "ord": 2,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "换成真实页面截图即可"
    },
    {
      "ord": 3,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "轨道是逐帧实测拟合出来的三拍，写在 `BEATS` 里：起点 0.200 / 0.483 / 0.688，行程"
    },
    {
      "ord": 4,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "0.185 / 0.150 / 0.150。归一化进度对 `inOutCubic` 拟合极好（缓起→中段冲→缓收），"
    },
    {
      "ord": 5,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "不是**常见的\"快进慢出\""
    },
    {
      "ord": 6,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": "inOutCubic",
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "首拍带长尾，用两条曲线加权混合：`0.85*seg(t, b, b+0.185, E.inOutCubic) +"
    },
    {
      "ord": 7,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": "outCubic",
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "0.15*seg(t, b, b+0.28, E.outCubic)`——主体在 0.185 内完成，剩 15% 拖到 0.48 才收住，"
    },
    {
      "ord": 8,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "所以首拍读起来明显比后两拍软"
    },
    {
      "ord": 9,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": [
        0.0,
        0.19
      ],
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": "outQuart",
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "开场有上一拍的收尾余量：`trackX = -11 * (1 - seg(t, 0, 0.19, E.outQuart))`，t=0 时"
    },
    {
      "ord": 10,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "轨道偏左 11px，在 0.19 内缓缓归位——一进画就\"正在收尾\"而非从静止启动"
    },
    {
      "ord": 11,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "环形轨道：`wx = ((trackX - i*SP) % RING + RING*1.5) % RING - RING/2`（SP=232，"
    },
    {
      "ord": 12,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "RING=4*232），把每块折进 ±RING/2 的窗口里。任一拍都保证左右各有一个邻居贴在画面"
    },
    {
      "ord": 13,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "边缘，走廊不断"
    },
    {
      "ord": 14,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "一切属性由离心距离 `d = min(1, |wx|/SP)` 驱动：`scale = lerp(1-d, 0.62, 1)`、"
    },
    {
      "ord": 15,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "`opacity = lerp(min(1, (1-d)*2.4), 0.78, 1)`、`blur = d*1.3px`、"
    },
    {
      "ord": 16,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "`zIndex = (1-d) > 0.5 ? 2 : 1`"
    },
    {
      "ord": 17,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "面板与胶囊下沉曲线**不同**：面板 `translateY(d*80)`，胶囊 `translateY(d*92)`——"
    },
    {
      "ord": 18,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "胶囊沉得更多，离心时会贴近面板顶边（实测中心 y 从 45 沉到 102）"
    },
    {
      "ord": 19,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "胶囊的\"高光\"是三层叠出来的：180° 渐变（亮→主→深）+ 内阴影上白下暗"
    },
    {
      "ord": 20,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "（`inset 0 2px 3px rgba(255,255,255,.65)` / `inset 0 -4px 8px rgba(34,39,47,.5)`）+"
    },
    {
      "ord": 21,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "一枚 76% 宽的白色渐变 shine 覆在上 38%"
    },
    {
      "ord": 22,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": [
        0.717,
        0.9
      ],
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": "outQuart",
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "光标：`seg(t, 0.717, 0.90, E.outQuart)`，opacity 在 0.717→0.725 内**硬现**（约 2f），"
    },
    {
      "ord": 23,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "位置从 (403,36) 减速滑到 (281,56)，之后到底几乎静止（每帧 <1px）"
    },
    {
      "ord": 24,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "三块漂移雾块走不同周期的 sin/cos（`t*2π*0.5` 与 `t*2π*0.4`），是唯一与轨道无关的"
    },
    {
      "ord": 25,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "背景活性层"
    }
  ],
